
.lib xformer.lib
.lib tube.lib

* Test Symetrical model
*V1 Vin1 0 SINE(0 150 30)
*V2 0 Vin2 SINE(0 150 30)

** Primary winding resistances
*Rp1 Vin1 P1 100 ; Primary winding 1 resistance
*Rp2 Vin2 P2 100 ; Primary winding 2 resistance

*XGC P1 0 P2 S1 0 GCSYMETRICAL

** Load resistor on secondary side
*Rload S1 0 1k

** Simulation control
*.tran 0 57m
*.end


* Test Push-Pul
XU1 n2 n3 n5 n6 0 GCOT-PP-04
Rs2 n3 n4 470
Rs1 n3 n1 470
R3 n6 0 8
Vin1 Vin1 0 SINE(0 50 30)
Vin2 0 Vin2 SINE(0 50 30)
V3 n3 0 394
XU2 n2 n1 Vin1 0 6V6GT
XU3 n5 n4 Vin2 0 6V6GT
.tran 100m

.backanno
.end
